  <div class="note warn">
    <b>Mini-board cautions:</b> GPIO8/9 are often the boot strapping pins (GPIO9 = boot mode).
    Keep I2C pull-ups modest (2.2&ndash;4.7&nbsp;k&Omega;) and disconnect the OLED/ToF while
    flashing if the board fails to boot. On boards that expose <code>5V</code>, verify it is a real
    5&nbsp;V rail before powering the amp from it; if unsure, power the amp from USB directly.
  </div>

